      <h2>Built to Find Subtle Failures</h2>
      <p>
        Odderon Lab creates focused hardware that helps engineers validate, debug,
        and refine embedded systems before they ship.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name comes from the odderon, a rare physics phenomenon detected through
        subtle interactions. The same idea guides the work here: pay attention to
        the small signals, awkward edge cases, and failures that are easy to miss.
      </p>
